X: 1
T: Enjoy the Silence
C: Martin Gore
O: Depeche Mode
N: Best effort, not fully verified. The vocal line is from a hamienet.com MIDI arrangement with the voice on its own channel; the only other arrangement that carries the verse melody disagrees about its pitches, so the verse in particular may be off.
N: Chords are that arrangement's bass and pad parts, bar by bar. The F# in the second verse bar is as in the MIDI. Moved an octave up from the MIDI so the lowest note is E-flat 4.
N: One pass is two verses and the chorus; the synth riff and the instrumental parts are left out.
